        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CFMBR  Victorian Reed Refrigerator Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis Victorian design appliance pull is reminiscent of the late 1800's, elaborate yet graceful, that embellished the european homes of the noble and wealthy.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis very decorative victorian design appliance pull handle is <b>1-3/16\" Diameter</b> with a <b>3\" projection</b>.  They are hand made and finished in the USA. Each one is unique with its own character.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available : <a href=\"/products/victorian-rope-appliance-pull-first-impressions-cfmbp\"><b>Victorian Rope Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIt is packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator / appliance door panel. We believe a refrigerator needs to have a 18\" or longer pull installed to  effectively pull open todays large \"vacuum\" sealed doors such as the ones found on a Sub Zero refrigerator. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions CFMBR  Victorian Reed  Appliance Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 5</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CFMBR-detail-picture.jpg?v=1718159558\" target=\"new\"><b>FII-CFMBR Detailed Picture</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>This appliance pull is available in 5 different standard lengths.</b>\r\n<li>FII-CFMBR-14: Total Length 14\" - Center to Center Mount - 12-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFMBR-16: Total Length 16\" - Center to Center Mount - 14-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFMBR-18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount - 16-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFMBR-20: Total Length 20\" - Center to Center Mount - 18-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFMBR-24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount - 22-3/8\"</li>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative appliance handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese Refrigerator pulls are supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4\" - 1\" thick panels (standard appliance panel thickness).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
